{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peculiar virus has taken root at the heart of an old computer system. As Little Bit, a newly-installed anti-virus, you are tasked with freeing the computer from the malware's clutches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level in <i>Tabula</i> is comprised of a set of traversable computer windows. Rearrange and layer the windows to create a path, so that Little Bit can reach and activate the level's checkpoints. Activate all checkpoints to open a portal to the end of the level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100100/extras/86e19104b0b98c283ec3b1d24b9c3222.poster.avif?t=1762474126\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100100/extras/86e19104b0b98c283ec3b1d24b9c3222.webm?t=1762474126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100100/extras/86e19104b0b98c283ec3b1d24b9c3222.mp4?t=1762474126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Navigate</strong></i>\u00a0a desktop made to feel like an old operating system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Arrange</strong></i> windows  to create a path forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Discover</strong></i> multiple unique solutions for each puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Choose</strong></i> the order in which you complete puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Unlock</strong></i> more folders with evolving complexity and new mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mu